<h2><span>WALDO FOUND MOMMY</span></h2>
</div>
<hr />
<p>Here's my attempt at a Scary Monster SCP™. Like I said, this month is full of firsts for me. Originally it was a lot more focused on the &quot;waldo&quot; part, but everyone said it didn't add anything, so this one is decently short.</p>
