					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rattles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4377609); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4377609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200523" alt="rattles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4377609)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rattles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4377609); return false;" >rattles</a></span> <span class="odate time_1558195951 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">18 May 2019 16:12</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4253461">
									

<p>This is quite good in concept and execution, but I honestly think it still has <em>tons</em> of phrasing and word choice gaffes that ought to have been rooted out in crit. In a lot of places, this article falls into the trap of using complex language to sound clinical where simpler language would suffice.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Some&nbsp;Examples</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Some&nbsp;Examples</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>Currently, it is only theorized that SCP-4885 is contained. To further elaborate, SCP-4885 is contained within an unknown Class-17 Containment Chamber in an unknown site.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>-&gt;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-4885 is theorized to be contained within an unknown Class-17 Containment Chamber in an unknown site. In the event that SCP-4885 breaches containment&#8230;</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-4885-1 instances discovered by far2.AIC will have specialized Foundation carrier drones to be dispatched and attempt to grab the body, and carry it to Location i, using a specialized AI to take routes that minimize the chance of unwanted civilian interference.</p>
</blockquote>
